  "description": "<h3 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"114\">🎛️ <strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"114\">ART Tube MP/C Project Series – Met doos & 3 maanden garantie</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"301\">Te koop aangeboden: <strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"168\">ART Tube MP/C Project Series</strong>, een professionele <strong data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"237\">buizen-microfoonvoorversterker met compressor</strong> — geleverd in <strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"270\">originele doos</strong> én mét <strong data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"300\">3 maanden garantie</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"330\">🔹 Productomschrijving</h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"565\">De <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"366\">ART Tube MP/C Project Series</strong> is een compacte en krachtige <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"416\">buizenmic-preamp</strong> die je geluid direct <strong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"468\">warm, vol en professioneel</strong> maakt. Dankzij de ingebouwde <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"512\">compressor</strong> en ruime <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"536\">gain-range</strong> is dit apparaat ideaal voor:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"588\">🎤 <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"588\">Vocal-opnames</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"617\">🎸 <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"617\">Instrument-tracking</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"648\">🎙️ <strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"648\">Podcasts & streaming</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<p data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"693\">🎧 <strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"693\">Home-studio & project-studio setups</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"734\">📌 <strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"734\">Belangrijkste kenmerken</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"1086\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"772\">Buizen-microfoonvoorversterker</strong> met warme, muzikale klank<br data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"801\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"829\">Ingebouwde compressor</strong> voor gecontroleerde dynamiek<br data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"861\">✔️ Maximaal ca. <strong data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"891\">70 dB gain</strong><br data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"894\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"919\">+48V phantom power</strong> voor condensatormicrofoons<br data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"949\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"984\">XLR & TRS-ingangen/uitgangen</strong><br data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"987\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1031\">Instelbare input, output & compressie</strong><br data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1034\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1056\">Compact formaat</strong> — netjes op je bureau of rack</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1119\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1119\">Wat zit er bij?</strong></h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1161\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1161\">🎛️ ART Tube MP/C Project Series unit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1187\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1185\">Originele doos</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1210\">🔌 Voedingsadapter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1238\">📄 <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1238\">3 maanden garantie</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
